# The source distribution carries the test suite whole, with what it reads: the tests, their conftest and
# helpers, the changelog, the user documentation (docs/, how-it-works.md and its images) and the examples.
# The benchmarking dataset is not shipped: the tests that need it skip.
include CHANGELOG.md
graft docs
graft examples
graft tests
global-exclude __pycache__/* *.py[cod] .DS_Store
